128 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 85 0 R/E(My journey in real estate began in the world of property flipping. While I loved the process of restoration by taking a house from disrepair and returning it to its former glory, I realized I wanted to do more than to transform buildings, I wanted to empower the people living in them. I wanted to guide families through the journey of homeownership and flipping as well. I took the step to master the rules and regulations of the industry so that I could serve as a licensed Real Estate Agent and Personal Advocate. Today, I use my eye for potential to help my clients see the hidden value in every home and build a lasting legacy for their families. I believe that every individual and family holds an untapped potential for homeownership and my mission is to help you realize it as well. As your Personal Advocate, I don't just facilitate transactions; I help you establish a sanctuary that will serve as the foundation for your family\220s future and for your generational legacy. With my commitment and expertise, I will personally guide you and provide the support necessary to navigate the markets with confidence. My greatest satisfaction comes from witnessing the moment a house becomes a home knowing that together, we have secured a fundamental piece of your life's aspirations.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

129 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 85 0 R/E(So, whether you are buying your first or second home or even an investment property or selling to start a new chapter, I am here to ensure that your move is handled with integrity, excellence, and a focus on the legacy you are building today. I am licensed in PA and MD, however i can assist you to buy and sell your home in any part of the country and in Canada as well.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

